<title>USA: Forcenergy sets $200 mln 144A snr sub notes.</title>
<headline>Forcenergy sets $200 mln 144A snr sub notes.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-02-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following issue from Forcenergy Inc was priced on Tuesday via Salomon Brothers Inc in the private placement market, according to sources.</p>
<p>BORROWER FORCENERGY INC</p>
<p>AMT $200 MLN	 COUPON 8.50 PCT   MATURITY 2/15/2007</p>
<p>TYPE SNR SUB NOTES ISS PRICE 99.338  FIRST PAY DATE 8/15/1997 LAST MOODY'S B1    YIELD 8.60 PCT    PAY FREQ  SEMI-ANNUAL</p>
<p>LAST S&amp;P B-PLUS    SPREAD +220 BPS   CALLABLE  NON-CALL FIVE</p>
<p>U.S. corporate bond unit, 212 859-1678</p>
</text>
